Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.82,0:16:36.82,Insert4 Eng,,0,0,0,,Just one more step
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.82,0:16:40.88,Insert4 Eng,,0,0,0,,With each one you take, make sure to shine
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.88,0:16:44.72,Insert4 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H3F2BDA&}The sign of the wings of courage
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.72,0:16:48.51,Insert4 Eng,,0,0,0,,Will connect them to you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.45,0:17:01.05,Insert4 Eng,,0,0,0,,Aah, I felt so insecure, I just hid myself
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.05,0:17:03.82,Insert4 Eng,,0,0,0,,My wish went flying away from me
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.82,0:17:08.40,Insert4 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H3F2BDA&}That's when you mutter "if it were me"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.40,0:17:09.83,Insert4 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H3F2BDA&}And bring out your courage
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.67,0:17:14.79,Insert4 Eng,,0,0,0,,Actually, {\3c&H3F2BDA&}even if{\3c&H53D1D9&} I feel a bit anxious
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.80,0:17:18.65,Insert4 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H3F2BDA&}I still {\3c&H53D1D9&}want to believe and try it
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.65,0:17:25.40,Insert4 Eng,,0,0,0,,Because I want to convey my {\3c&H3F2BDA&}fiery feelings{\3c&H53D1D9&} for once
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.50,0:17:29.40,Insert4 Eng,,0,0,0,,Just one more step
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.40,0:17:33.80,Insert4 Eng,,0,0,0,,If you look ahead, the view will clear up
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.80,0:17:36.36,Insert4 Eng,,0,0,0,,When my heart awakens
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.36,0:17:41.35,Insert4 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H3F2BDA&}I'm sure I'll get to {\3c&H53D1D9&}jump even farther
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.51,0:17:44.49,Insert4 Eng,,0,0,0,,Just one more step
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.49,0:17:48.32,Insert4 Eng,,0,0,0,,With each one you take, spread them
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.68,0:17:52.31,Insert4 Eng,,0,0,0,,The sign of the wings of courage
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.31,0:17:56.44,Insert4 Eng,,0,0,0,,Will connect towards you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.70,0:17:59.82,Insert4 Eng,,0,0,0,,Just one more step
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.82,0:18:03.80,Insert4 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H3F2BDA&}Put your strength into each one you take
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.80,0:18:06.34,Insert4 Eng,,0,0,0,,Let your heart shine
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.55,0:18:15.05,Insert4 Eng,,0,0,0,,A paper airplane flies towards tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.05,0:18:18.65,Insert4 Eng,,0,0,0,,The sign of the wings of courage
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.65,0:18:22.41,Insert4 Eng,,0,0,0,,Will be connected starting from you
