Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.64,0:13:38.68,Insert6 Eng,,0,0,0,,Even if I lose sight of my path
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.18,0:13:42.64,Insert6 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HB36BDD&}Any path can be made to shine
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.64,0:13:44.81,Insert6 Eng,,0,0,0,,That's Special
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.52,0:13:50.66,Insert6 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HB36BDD&}Even when there are times you feel like{\3c&HDD6BB7&} looking back
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.66,0:13:55.83,Insert6 Eng,,0,0,0,,Everyone's voices will shine under the light
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.83,0:13:57.78,Insert6 Eng,,0,0,0,,That's Special
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.81,0:14:03.99,Insert6 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HB36BDD&}Your story up to now will become your hope
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.44,0:14:09.04,Insert6 Eng,,0,0,0,,No future is off limits, just look and see!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.07,0:14:14.60,Insert6 Eng,,0,0,0,,That's right, take those shine memories of yours
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.60,0:14:17.58,Insert6 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HB36BDD&}And carry them with your voice
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.58,0:14:21.10,Insert6 Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's change into what we want to be
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.10,0:14:24.70,Insert6 Eng,,0,0,0,,A path is something you make yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.70,0:14:31.30,Insert6 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HB36BDD&}If you want to hold onto all your {\3c&HDD6BB7&}hope and wishes
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.30,0:14:34.90,Insert6 Eng,,0,0,0,,Just go and do it
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.02,0:14:45.75,Insert6 Eng,,0,0,0,,The things you wished for will take shape right here
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.19,0:14:49.69,Insert6 Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, you are not alone
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.69,0:14:53.17,Insert6 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HB36BDD&}Just keep holding onto your feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.17,0:15:00.20,Insert6 Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's draw our path with all our hope and wishes
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.20,0:15:03.56,Insert6 Eng,,0,0,0,,Until it all comes true
