Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.88,0:00:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,When I open the Mirror Compact,\N I turn into my stylish self with make-up and coords!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.64,0:00:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Idol Princess: AiPri!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.36,0:00:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the shining wish that sparkles deep within your heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.86,0:00:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll grant everyone's wishes with our radiant lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.13,0:00:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Inori-chan, Gumi-chan and Nana-chan's radiant smiles pop on together into Smile Heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.32,0:00:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And Aoi-chan, Olivia-chan and Emma-chan's cool and charming selves bring on Pure Heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.42,0:00:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The fourth AiPri Fest had performances by these two groups, and everyone was ecstatic!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.38,0:00:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Onegai Town was brimming with smiles!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.66,0:00:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to bring about the Goddess' Miracle, \Nthe Wish Granting Squad continues to do their best every day!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.46,0:02:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... it was a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.50,0:02:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Aoi! Good morning-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.79,0:02:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The day I met Fortu, one year ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.38,0:02:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Aoi?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.80,0:02:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh!? Aoi stayed home today because of a cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.78,0:03:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wakaba-san said she's been in her bed all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.43,0:03:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes me a bit worried...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.44,0:03:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope Aoi-chan is doing fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.78,0:03:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Gumigumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.01,0:03:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.80,0:03:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be helping out at the shop today, so I'll make a bunch of tasty snacks and send them to Aoi-chan so she cheers up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.50,0:03:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds good to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.12,0:03:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Norinori amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.44,0:03:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna do something for her too...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.13,0:03:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I agree...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.13,0:03:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna see Aoi-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.17,0:03:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Aoi...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.79,0:03:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Goddess...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.12,0:03:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The AiPri Shop...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.12,0:03:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? And this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.54,0:04:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Me and Onee-chan from the past...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.80,0:04:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I just found my dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.11,0:04:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,A dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.40,0:04:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,My dream is to become an AiPri!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.00,0:04:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,An AiPri...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.80,0:04:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,When they stand on that shiny stage,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.79,0:04:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,they get to sing, and dance,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.24,0:04:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,and make everyone happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.88,0:04:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I like it! I'll be rooting for your dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.64,0:04:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's go to the AiPri Shop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.12,0:04:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll need a Mirror Compact to become an AiPri, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.53,0:04:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get one from Meganee-san for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.12,0:04:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.66,0:04:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll practice my singing and dancing first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.12,0:04:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll become an AiPri once I'm good at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.52,0:04:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are a cautious one, Aoi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.98,0:04:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you ever heard the story of Onegai Town's great wonder?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.02,0:04:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.47,0:04:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They say that if you make a wish to the Goddess, \Nyour wish will be granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.14,0:05:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh!?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.11,0:05:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,To the Goddess!?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.60,0:05:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you try it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.53,0:05:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'll do it after I practice!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.46,0:05:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.54,0:05:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.47,0:05:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I would practice a lot every day, with the thought that I'd become an AiPri once I'm confident enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.84,0:05:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.11,0:05:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I was never able to gain that confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.12,0:05:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And without becoming an AiPri, time just marched on...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.59,0:05:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Aoi-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.70,0:05:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.72,0:05:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it about time you tried out being an AiPri?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.45,0:05:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... There are these AiPri I look up to...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.47,0:05:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,They always work hard, and are cute and kind...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.14,0:05:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I still can't shine like them...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.88,0:06:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that really so?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.32,0:06:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you are already shining, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.46,0:06:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Can my wish really be granted...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.83,0:06:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I really gain that confidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.43,0:06:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,AiPri is my dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.47,0:06:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,My desire to become an AiPri must be...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.12,0:06:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it definitely is true!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.45,0:06:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Lady Goddess!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.13,0:06:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, make me into an AiPri!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.80,0:06:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,As if...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.12,0:07:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have brought an umbrella...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.80,0:07:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Chu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.17,0:07:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.46,0:07:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Chu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.18,0:07:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.45,0:07:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,A plushie?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.79,0:07:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It really rained a lot...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.45,0:07:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What was this plushie doing there...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.79,0:08:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortu-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.79,0:08:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha!?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.14,0:08:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Chu?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.20,0:08:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Chu?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.22,0:08:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Whaaa!?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.12,0:08:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Did that dog plushie just start talking!?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.48,0:08:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a dog, nor a plushie-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.16,0:08:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Fortu-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.82,0:08:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortu?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.58,0:08:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What is your name-chu?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.48,0:08:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Mine?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.96,0:08:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is... Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.12,0:08:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Aoi. Yumemiya Aoi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.94,0:08:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Aoi! I came to grant your wish-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.26,0:08:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha!?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.13,0:08:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.15,0:08:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.92,0:08:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,A Mirror Compact!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.62,0:08:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Starting today, you are an AiPri-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.54,0:08:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be... an AiPri?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.08,0:09:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to become an AiPri,\N and help the Goddess regain her power-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.11,0:09:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And to do that, you'll be granting everyone's wishes-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.13,0:09:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The Goddess? Wishes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.82,0:09:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't just tell me all that so suddenly...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.49,0:09:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Chu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.47,0:09:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna try it out-chu!?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.14,0:09:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,To grant everyone's wishes...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.79,0:09:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I really do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.06,0:09:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dream to become an AiPri is stronger than anyone else's-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.46,0:09:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Those feelings have reached me-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.48,0:09:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And because of that, I believe in you, Aoi-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.56,0:09:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Insert this Onegai Jewel into your Mirror Compact-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.15,0:10:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to root for everyone's dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.97,0:10:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially Fortu's dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.47,0:10:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it, for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.47,0:10:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Aoi! Aoi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.80,0:10:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for waking you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.30,0:10:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I've made rice porridge. Do you want it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.19,0:10:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.82,0:10:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Put in an egg too...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.62,0:10:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.13,0:10:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Onee-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.34,0:10:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.74,0:10:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I... became an AiPri...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.19,0:10:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.21,0:10:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But... I still have to grant that first wish...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.78,0:11:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.83,0:11:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm Inori and the others, I know we can...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.11,0:11:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they are all worried for you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.13,0:11:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So you gotta get better soon, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.81,0:11:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Aoi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.86,0:11:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,May Aoi get better soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.12,0:11:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.44,0:11:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Chu!?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.47,0:11:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Chu? Chu-chu?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.52,0:11:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Chuchu-chuchu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.46,0:11:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wish catchu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.13,0:11:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I just got a wish from Wakaba-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.81,0:12:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for the Wish Granting Squad to act-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.30,0:12:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortu-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.28,0:12:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I see everyone is here-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.95,0:12:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ohohohoho! Of course I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.94,0:12:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what the Wish Granting Squad is for!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.94,0:12:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We will all be granting Wakaba-san's wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.96,0:12:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And Gumi-san is also doing something for Aoi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.05,0:12:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make the gumigumi perfect snacks for her to feel better!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.79,0:12:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what she said!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.94,0:12:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.28,0:12:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Emma-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.31,0:12:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Norinori, indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.63,0:12:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey there, all my Prifriends! Is everybody enjoying your day!?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.70,0:12:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's MC Priusa-pyon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.84,0:12:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Pyon pyon pyon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.62,0:13:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This live was requested by someone who wants to cheer up their friend-pyon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.31,0:13:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.18,0:13:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready! To party!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.48,0:13:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we pyon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.30,0:14:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your hope shine even more!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.95,0:14:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Buzzlume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.33,0:14:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is insane! It's a Buzzlume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.96,0:14:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,May my radiant hope reach you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.94,0:14:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Buzzlume Live, start!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.31,0:14:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This shiny stage will be sure to bring joy to their beloved friend-pyon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.95,0:15:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall be going too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.24,0:15:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.32,0:15:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll fly through the heavens with wings of courage!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.94,0:15:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall make the flames of your passion overcome their limits!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.26,0:15:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Coord change, The Castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.60,0:15:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.64,0:15:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's make-up time-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.26,0:15:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheeks!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.26,0:15:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Lips!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.60,0:15:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Cologne!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.95,0:16:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Shine, Onegai Jewel!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.26,0:16:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Coord change-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.42,0:16:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Today's coord is Apron Bouquet!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.65,0:16:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The floral pattern peeking through the gap between the layered skirts looks so stylish!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.94,0:16:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.92,0:16:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Live stage, open!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.92,0:16:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my wish-granting live!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.59,0:16:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I will support everyone's feelings!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.95,0:16:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Our courage and passion-filled live will now start!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.56,0:16:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.27,0:17:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your courage shine even more!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.26,0:17:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Buzzlume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.66,0:17:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This is insane! It's a Buzzlume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.70,0:17:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,May my light of courage reach you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.25,0:17:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Buzzlume Live, start!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.62,0:17:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Their courage is on fire! Full energy-pyon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.61,0:18:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.28,0:18:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel better now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.60,0:18:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortu-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.26,0:18:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Onegai Prism-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.93,0:18:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's an AiPri Card-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.62,0:19:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Mystery Phantom card-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.29,0:19:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.61,0:19:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems our feelings reached her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.26,0:19:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.26,0:19:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Aoi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.60,0:19:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.34,0:19:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you feeling better now-chu?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.60,0:19:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.60,0:19:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's lives reached right into my heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.11,0:19:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.65,0:19:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.99,0:19:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Aoi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.27,0:19:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Gumi-chan sent this for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.94,0:19:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.94,0:19:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow! They look so tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.61,0:19:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,These are the donuts I requested-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.96,0:19:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Requested?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.98,0:19:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortu, so you just wanted to eat them yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.25,0:19:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you also love Patisserie Tomosaka's donuts-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.26,0:19:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.93,0:20:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Chu?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.64,0:20:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's from Inori-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.91,0:20:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a video.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.92,0:20:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Aoi-san, are you feeling better?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.37,0:20:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you get the donuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.26,0:20:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And did you see our lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.26,0:20:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone is waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.61,0:20:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you're feeling better, let's all do AiPri together again!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.28,0:20:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Norinori love!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.93,0:20:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,See you soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.29,0:20:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Girls...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.94,0:20:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Fortu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.46,0:20:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Chu?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.94,0:20:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I used to always feel anxious, worried about whether I'd be able to grant your wish by myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.02,0:20:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So the Lady Goddess has lost her power to grant everyone's wishes, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.59,0:20:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes-chu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.59,0:20:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.59,0:20:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because the hearts of those in Onegai Town have stopped believing in the Goddess-chu...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.24,0:21:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, if the Goddess does not regain her power,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.94,0:21:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,the Prism of Despair dormant within Onegai Town might awaken-chu...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.60,0:21:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Prism of Despair...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.10,0:21:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Chu!?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.10,0:21:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Aoi, look at that girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.64,0:21:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.94,0:21:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,She's shining...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.31,0:21:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That day I met Inori, and she became my friend and ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.59,0:21:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I don't feel anxious anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.96,0:21:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not scared of that Prism of Despair!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.01,0:21:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,To bring back the Goddess' power is Fortu's dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.25,0:21:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.27,0:21:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No, the Wish Granting Squad will definitely make it true!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.90,0:21:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Chu...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.61,0:22:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.60,0:22:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Aoi!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.26,0:22:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.28,0:22:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you got better from that cold, Aoi-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.27,0:22:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Please continue to bring happiness to Onegai Town alongside everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.61,0:22:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.08,0:23:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello! I'm Kyouka from the Onegai AiPri Club!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.75,0:23:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The card they got today is the Mystery Phantom!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.74,0:23:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The black cape is its highlight!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.84,0:24:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Just put on a mask and it'll be perfect for a ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.38,0:24:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay tuned for next episode's card!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.72,0:24:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Yumemiya Aoi!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.26,0:24:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The fever's gone, now I'm full of energy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.93,0:24:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta do our best to bring the Goddess back, Fortu!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.77,0:24:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time, on Onegai AiPri.
